# The corpus is regenerated deterministically by generate_corpus.py from the
# tracked c47Test.sav, and `zig build state_load_fuzz` regenerates it if absent.
# Track the generator, not its ~360 KB of derived output or the expectations file
# the generator emits alongside it -- both must always match the generator, and
# tracking them invites the two drifting apart.
*.sav
expectations.txt
